      "thinking": "Let me analyze the situation. It's turn 4, I'm at 20 life, opponent at 19. I have Callous Inspector 1/1 and Hog-Monkey 3/2 in play, 3 Swamps. Opponent has Avatar Enthusiasts 2/2 (summoning sick), Forest, Plains, Plains (all tapped).\n\
