\n\
Wait, also Hog-Monkey takes damage back: Suki deals 2 (plus Suki's anthem gives other creatures +1/+0 — Earth King gets +1/+0, so Earth King deals 4). Total damage to Hog-Monkey: 2 + 4 = 6. Hog-Monkey has 4 toughness. It dies! Hmm, that's unfortunate. Wait, Hog-Monkey is 5/4. Suki is 2/4, Earth King is 3/2 but with Suki's +1/+0 anthem, Earth King is 4/2. So Hog-Monkey takes 2+4=6 damage, dies.\n\
\n\
