\n\
Wait, actually, let me reconsider whether killing Earth King could be better. If Suki survives with 3 damage marked... nothing else to deal damage. Hmm, I have Barrels of Blasting Jelly in hand — costs {1} to play, then {5},T,Sac to deal 5 to a creature. That's expensive.\n\
\n\
Alternative: assign 3 to Suki and 2 to Earth King — kills Earth King, Suki at 3 marked. Not killing Suki.\n\
\n\
The most damage-oriented play: kill Suki. Suki's 2/4 body blocks well and anthems. Kill it.\n\
\n\
