\n\
Actually, could I cast Treetop Freedom Fighters this turn? I have 2 untapped Swamps + Barrels ability ({1}: add one mana of any color). So tap Barrels with 1 swamp for red, leaving 1 swamp... that's only {1}{R} total = 2 mana, but Treetop costs {2}{R} = 3 mana. Not enough. So no.\n\
\n\
