\n\
Let me think. Next turn I have 7 lands (6 Swamps + Mountain) + Barrels mana. I can cast Freedom Fighters (2R) and attack with Merchants + Freedom Fighters + Ally token.\n\
\n\
Actually, let me reconsider: should I block with Merchants instead? Trading Merchants for Bear... my board becomes Inspector + Freedom Fighters (in hand). Their board: Suki 5/4, Earth King 2/2, Toph 2/3, Forest 2/2. That's worse for me — Merchants is my best card.\n\
\n\
So block with Inspector, or don't block.\n\
\n\
