Hmm, actually, hold on. Let me reconsider whether they even still have Suki as a blocker that matters... Suki is 5/4. Merchants is 5/4 (or 6/5 after trigger). If Suki blocks Merchants 6/5: Suki deals 5, Merchants has 5 toughness → dies. Merchants deals 6 to Suki → dies. Trade. So without Barrels, attacking Merchants into Suki = trade. With Barrels killing Suki first, Merchants runs over the small blockers.\n\
\n\
Also worth noting: after Barrels is sacrificed, I lose the {1}: Add mana ability, but I have 7 lands so mana is fine.\n\
\n\
Alright, let me also double check timing: Barrels ability \"{5}, {T}, Sacrifice {this}: It deals 5 damage to target creature.\" It's an activated ability, instant speed presumably. Suki is a creature, target it. 5 damage to 5/4 → destroyed. Good.\n\
\n\
