        "rationale": "Assigning 4 damage to Suki (lethal) and 1 to The Earth King. Suki's +1/+0 anthem and token generation are the bigger long-term threats, and with Suki gone the Earth King drops back to 3/2 and can't trigger its own power-4 attack ramp. Hog-Monkey dies either way, so I trade it for their best creature while the unblocked Inspector chips them to 7.",
