      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent attacked with the 4/4 Bear token alone (ramping a land off Earth King's trigger). I'm at 13, they're at 7. I'm chump-blocking the Bear with Callous Inspector only — NOT double-blocking with Merchants, because the attacker picks damage order and would kill my Merchants in a trade for a mere token.",
        "blockers": "p46:p53",
        "rationale": "Chump-blocking with Inspector converts 4 combat damage into 1 self-damage from its death trigger, and the Clue token it makes is perfect free sacrifice fodder for Beetle-Headed Merchants' attack trigger next turn (draw a card, grow to 6/5) without the life loss. Double-blocking would let the opponent order damage to kill Merchants — a terrible trade of my best creature for a token.",
      },
